  "description": "Ever since Do-Hyeon walked into that lonely space, Jae-Won has been pining for him for six years. Jae-Won even went so far as to follow him and enroll in the same college. When he visited Do-Hyeon’s apartment with a fluttering heart, what he found was a half-naked Do-Hyeon and his girlfriend. Still, he thought that once he got inside, they could go back to the way things used to be… But unlike Jae-Won, who’s trying his best to worm his way into Do-Hyeon’s daily life, Do-Hyeon is busy pushing him away.\n\n *“I told you I like you, didn’t I?”\n\n“You were just lonely back then. I just happened to be there.”*\n\nHis six years of unwavering affection are dismissed as mere loneliness, and his desire to grow closer is repeatedly rebuffed. Will the two of them be able to make their living arrangement work?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
